flowchart TD
  A([Staff member on ticket list or detail page]) --> B[Click Edit on a ticket]
  B --> C[Edit form pre-filled with current values]
  C --> D[Change fields, including status]
  D --> E[Click Save changes]
  E --> F{Inputs valid?}
  F -- No --> G[Inline error messages shown]
  G --> D
  F -- Yes --> H[Update ticket in Supabase, set updated_at]
  H --> I{Saved OK?}
  I -- No --> J[Error toast shown, edits kept]
  J --> E
  I -- Yes --> K[Success toast shown]
  K --> L[Return to ticket detail with new values]
  L --> M([End])
  C --> N[Click Cancel]
  N --> L
